- **F1 (PHP seat): the `cst.cljc` category.** Recommended `:deferred-scope`: it is a `.cljc` stage file (§3.1 names `yang.antlr.cst` deferred, §9.3), so the seams-row rationale ("takes every lane file") no longer applies after the `.clj` → `.cljc` rename. The alternative — `:seam-driver` mirroring the lane `cst` files — requires a 9th bounded exception and amending the test's 8-files/12-rows constants (§8.1 amendment). Category assignment is defensible either way; the choice is the PHP seat's.
